# 11 · Jung unccrarq ynfg avtug? — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Gur hfhny zbeavat purpx vf `terc -p REEBE`. Vg nafjref "ubj znal yvarf fnl reebe?", naq gung vf gur
jebat dhrfgvba sbe n penfu. N cebprff gung qvrf, n ubfg gung ybfrf cbjre, n pbagnvare gung gur
xreary BBZ-xvyyf: abar bs gurz trg gb jevgr n ynfg yvar. Jung n penfu yrnirf vf n **fvyrapr**. Gur
yvarf orsber vg ner abezny, gur yvarf nsgre vg fgneg jvgu n obbg zrffntr, naq gur bayl rivqrapr vf
gur qvfgnapr orgjrra 2 gvzrfgnzcf. Lbh svaq n fvyrapr bayl ol ybbxvat ng rirel yvar va beqre naq
nfxvat ubj ybat ntb gur cerivbhf bar jnf.

Gur frpbaq ceboyrz vf fvmr. Bar srrqre jevgrf nobhg 600 yvarf n avtug. Gur syrrg jevgrf 40 000
gvzrf gung, naq n freire ybt sebz n ohfl freivpr vf tvtnolgrf. `bf.ErnqSvyr` cyhf `fgevatf.Fcyvg`
jbexf ba gur fnzcyr ba lbhe yncgbc naq trgf BBZ-xvyyrq ba gur erny svyr. N fhzznel qbrf abg arrq
gur yvarf vg nyernql pbhagrq, fb vg fubhyq abg xrrc gurz: ernq 1 yvar, hcqngr n srj ahzoref,
sbetrg gur yvar. Gung vf n **fgernz**, naq Tb'f jbeq sbe "fbzrguvat lbh pna ernq n fgernz sebz" vf
`vb.Ernqre`.

Gur guveq ceboyrz vf gur dhvrg snvyher. N gbby gung ernqf n fgernz pna fgbc rneyl: n qvfx reebe, n
qebccrq pbaarpgvba, n yvar gbb ybat sbe gur ohssre. Vs vg gura cevagf vgf ercbeg nf vs gur vachg
unq raqrq, gur ercbeg vf jebat naq ybbxf evtug. "3 reebef, ab tncf" sbe n svyr jubfr frpbaq unys
jnf arire ernq vf jbefr guna ab ercbeg ng nyy.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Qrpvqr jung lbh erzrzore.** Orsber lbh jevgr pbqr, gnxr gur ERNQZR rknzcyr naq ernq vg yvar
ol yvar ba cncre. Nsgre rnpu yvar, jevgr qbja bayl jung lbh arrq sbe gur svany ercbeg: gur yvar
pbhag, gur znysbezrq pbhag, gur yriry pbhagf, gur svefg gvzr, gur gvzr bs gur yngrfg inyvq yvar
naq gur tncf fb sne. Gung vf gur jubyr fgngr. Abguvat va vg tebjf jvgu gur ahzore bs yvarf, rkprcg
gur yvfg bs tncf, naq gung tebjf jvgu gur ahzore bs vapvqragf. Guvf "jung zhfg V xrrc?" dhrfgvba
vf gur pber bs rirel fgernzvat ceboyrz; 29-terc nfxf vg ntnva jvgu pbagrkg yvarf.

**2. Pynffvsl rnpu yvar bapr, gura npg.** Rnpu yvar vf rknpgyl 1 bs 3 xvaqf: oynax, znysbezrq be
inyvq. Qrpvqr gur xvaq svefg, sebz gur svryqf nybar, naq bayl gura gbhpu gur pbhagref. Gura n
znysbezrq yvar pnaabg unys-pbhag, sbe rknzcyr nqq vgf yriry ohg abg vgf gvzr.

**3. Chg rirel obhaqnel ba 1 fvqr.** Nf va 07-ebyypnyy: "zber guna `zvaTnc`" zrnaf gung rknpgyl
`zvaTnc` vf abg n tnc. N onpxjneqf whzc vf n artngvir qvssrerapr, naq n artngvir ahzore vf arire
zber guna n cbfvgvir `zvaTnc`, fb vg arrqf ab pbqr bs vgf bja. `zvaTnc <= 0` vf gur fjvgpu gung
gheaf tnc qrgrpgvba bss. Jevgr gurfr 3 pnfrf vagb lbhe grfg yvfg orsber lbh jevgr gur `vs`.

**4. Qrpvqr jung na reebe yrnirf oruvaq.** Jura gur vachg oernxf unysjnl, lbh unir 2 pubvprf:
guebj njnl jung lbh pbhagrq, be erghea vg jvgu gur reebe. Gur frpbaq vf zber hfrshy: "gur svefg
3 ubhef jrer dhvrg, gura gur qvfx snvyrq" vf vasbezngvba. Tb znxrf guvf purnc, orpnhfr n shapgvba
pna erghea n inyhr naq na reebe gbtrgure. Gur pnyyre zhfg gura purpx gur reebe orsber gehfgvat gur
inyhr, naq lbhe qbp pbzzrag zhfg fnl jung gur inyhr zrnaf jura gur reebe vf abg avy.

**5. Frcnengr pbhagvat sebz cevagvat.** `Fhzznevmr` ergheaf n fgehpg; `Jevgr` gheaf gur fgehpg vagb
grkg. Gur grfgf purpx gur 2 ncneg, n pbzznaq pna cevag gur fnzr fhzznel nf grkg be nf WFBA, naq n
grfg arire unf gb pbzcner n ercbeg gb purpx n pbhag.

## Pbaprcgf

### vb.Ernqre: 1 zrgubq, znal fbheprf

```tb
glcr Ernqre vagresnpr {
	Ernq(c []olgr) (a vag, ree reebe)
}
```

`Ernq` svyyf hc gb `yra(c)` olgrf naq fnlf ubj znal vg svyyrq. Na `*bf.Svyr` vf n ernqre, fb ner
`bf.Fgqva`, n argjbex pbaarpgvba, na UGGC erfcbafr obql naq `tmvc.ArjErnqre(s)` sbe n ebgngrq
`srrqre.ybt.tm`. N shapgvba gung gnxrf na `vb.Ernqre` jbexf jvgu nyy bs gurz, naq va n grfg lbh
cnff `fgevatf.ArjErnqre("...")` vafgrnq bs n svyr. Guvf vf gur svefg vagresnpr bs gur pbhefr gung
gur fgnaqneq yvoenel vf ohvyg nebhaq; gvre 4 (16-erqnpg) jevgrf glcrf gung bgure pbqr pnyyf
guebhtu vagresnprf yvxr vg.

Gur pbagenpg unf 3 fragraprf gung znggre urer:

- `Ernq` znl erghea srjre olgrf guna nfxrq, rira jura zber ner pbzvat. Qb abg nffhzr 1 pnyy tvirf
  1 yvar, be gur jubyr svyr.
- `Ernq` znl erghea `a > 0` **naq** na reebe va gur fnzr pnyy. Hfr gur `a` olgrf svefg, gura ybbx
  ng gur reebe.
- `vb.RBS` vf gur reebe gung zrnaf "gur raq, nf rkcrpgrq". Rirel bgure reebe zrnaf fbzrguvat jrag
  jebat.

Trggvat nyy 3 evtug ol unaq vf n fznyy fgngr znpuvar. Gung vf jul lbh eneryl pnyy `Ernq` lbhefrys.

### ohsvb.Fpnaare: yvarf sebz n ernqre

`ohsvb.Fpnaare` jencf n ernqre naq unaqf bhg 1 gbxra ng n gvzr, yvarf ol qrsnhyg:

```tb
fp := ohsvb.ArjFpnaare(s)
sbe fp.Fpna() {
	cebprff(fp.Grkg())
}
vs ree := fp.Ree(); ree != avy {
	// gur vachg qvq abg raq abeznyyl
}
```

Vg unaqyrf gur 3 pbagenpg fragraprf nobir. Vg qebcf gur `\a` naq n `\e` evtug orsber vg, naq vg
ergheaf n ynfg yvar jvgubhg `\a` gbb. Gjb qrgnvyf qrpvqr jurgure lbhe gbby vf pbeerpg:

- `Fpna` ergheaf snyfr ng gur raq **naq** ba na reebe. `Ree` ergheaf avy nsgre n pyrna `vb.RBS`, naq
  gur erny reebe bgurejvfr. Gur ybbc nobir ybbxf svavfurq va obgu pnfrf, fb gur `Ree` purpx nsgre
  vg vf abg bcgvbany.
- N yvar zhfg svg va gur fpnaare'f ohssre, juvpu znl tebj gb `ohsvb.ZnkFpnaGbxraFvmr` (64 XvO).
  N ybatre yvar fgbcf gur fpnaare jvgu `ohsvb.ReeGbbYbat`. Sbe na npprff ybt be n srrqre ybt gung
  vf svar. Sbe ybtf jvgu WFBA obqvrf ba 1 yvar, pnyy `Fpnaare.Ohssre` gb envfr gur yvzvg: 29-terc
  qbrf rknpgyl gung.

`fp.Grkg()` ergheaf n arj fgevat rnpu gvzr. `fp.Olgrf()` ergheaf n fyvpr vagb gur fpnaare'f ohssre
gung gur arkg `Fpna` birejevgrf: svar sbe n dhvpx ybbx, jebat sbe nalguvat lbh xrrc.

### vb.Jevgre naq gur reebef abobql purpxf

`vb.Jevgre` vf gur zveebe vzntr: `Jevgr(c []olgr) (a vag, ree reebe)`. `szg.Scevags(j, ...)`
sbezngf vagb n ohssre naq pnyyf `j.Jevgr` bapr, fb vg ergheaf gung jevgr'f reebe. N jevgr snvyf
zber bsgra guna crbcyr guvax: n shyy qvfx, n pybfrq cvcr (`avtugybt | urnq -3`), n argjbex
pbaarpgvba gung jrag njnl. Pbqr gung vtaberf gur reebe jevgrf unys n ercbeg naq rkvgf 0.

Purpxvat nsgre rirel yvar jbexf ohg ohevrf gur ercbeg sbezng va `vs ree != avy` oybpxf. Gur Tb
oybt cbfg "Reebef ner inyhrf" fubjf gur hfhny nygreangvir: n fznyy glcr gung erzrzoref gur svefg
reebe naq gheaf rirel yngre jevgr vagb n ab-bc, jvgu 1 purpx ng gur raq. `ohsvb.Jevgre` jbexf gur
fnzr jnl vafvqr: nsgre n snvyrq jevgr vg ergheaf gur fnzr reebe sbe rirel yngre pnyy.

### Jenccvat reebef jvgu %j

Nf va 06-frzire: `szg.Reebes("avtugybt: nsgre yvar %q: %j", a, ree)` nqqf pbagrkg naq xrrcf gur
bevtvany reebe vafvqr, fb `reebef.Vf(ree, ohsvb.ReeGbbYbat)` be `reebef.Vf(ree, sf.ReeCrezvffvba)`
fgvyy jbexf sbe gur pnyyre. Jvgu `%i` gur grkg fheivirf ohg gur yvax vf tbar, naq gur pnyyre pna
bayl pbzcner fgevatf.

### Gvzrf xrrc gurve mbar

`gvzr.Cnefr` jvgu `gvzr.ESP3339` ergheaf n `gvzr.Gvzr` va gur mbar bs gur grkg: `M` tvirf HGP,
`+02:00` tvirf n svkrq mbar bs +2 u. `Fho` naq pbzcnevfbaf jbex ba gur vafgnag, fb n 47-zvahgr
fvyrapr gung fgnegf va HGP naq raqf va `+02:00` vf fgvyy 47 zvahgrf (07-ebyypnyy fubjrq jul `==`
vf gur jebat pbzcnevfba). Cevagvat vf n qvssrerag znggre: `Sbezng` hfrf gur mbar gur inyhr pneevrf.
Xrrc gur inyhr lbh cnefrq, naq gur ercbeg fubjf jung gur ybt fnvq; pnyy `.HGP()` naq gur ercbeg
fubjf gvzrf gung nccrne va ab ybt yvar.

### Znc beqre, bapr zber

Nf va 03-cntrabvfr: n `enatr` bire n znc ivfvgf gur xrlf va n enaqbz beqre, ba checbfr. Gur ercbeg
zhfg or gur fnzr ba rirel eha, fb pbyyrpg gur yriry anzrf, fbeg gurz, gura cevag.

### grfgvat/vbgrfg

`grfgvat/vbgrfg` unf ernqref gung zvforunir va yrtny jnlf: `BarOlgrErnqre` ergheaf 1 olgr cre
pnyy, `UnysErnqre` unys bs jung lbh nfxrq sbe, `QngnReeErnqre` ergheaf gur ynfg olgrf gbtrgure
jvgu `vb.RBS`, `ReeErnqre` snvyf ng bapr, `GvzrbhgErnqre` snvyf ba vgf frpbaq pnyy. Vs lbhe pbqr vf
pbeerpg sbe n cynva `fgevatf.Ernqre`, vg fubhyq or pbeerpg sbe nyy bs gurz. N grfg gung ehaf gur
fnzr vachg guebhtu rnpu bar svaqf pbqr gung nffhzrf "1 `Ernq` vf 1 yvar" va zvyyvfrpbaqf.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Ab `Fpnaare.Ree` purpx.** Gur zbfg pbzzba oht va Tb ybt gbbyf. N ernq reebe be n 70 XvO yvar
  raqf gur ybbc fvyragyl, naq gur ercbeg pbiref cneg bs gur svyr.
- **Pbzcnevat jvgu gur rneyvrfg be gur yngrfg gvzr** vafgrnq bs gur cerivbhf inyvq yvar. Nsgre n
  onpxjneqf whzc, rirel yvar hagvy gur pybpx pngpurf hc ybbxf abezny be ybbxf yvxr n tnc, qrcraqvat
  ba juvpu bar lbh cvpxrq.
- **Yrggvat n znysbezrq yvar erfrg gur tnc.** N yvar yvxr `2026-10-16G03:12:` vf jevggra evtug jura
  gur cbjre tbrf. Vgf gvzr qbrf abg pbhag, be vg jbhyq uvqr gur fvyrapr vg orybatf gb.
- **`>=` vafgrnq bs `>`.** Jvgu urnegorngf rirel 10 zvahgrf naq `zvaTnc` 10z, rirel urnegorng
  orpbzrf n tnc.
- **N avy `Yriryf` znc** sbe na rzcgl vachg. Ernqvat n avy znc jbexf; jevgvat gb vg cnavpf, naq n
  pnyyre gung nqqf vgf bja pbhagf trgf gung cnavp.
- **Pbairegvat gvzrf gb HGP**, be cevagvat gurz jvgu `gvzr.ESP3339Anab`. Obgu punatr gur ercbeg.
- **Jevgvat ba nsgre na reebe**, be ergheavat gur reebe jvgubhg `%j`.
- **`bf.ErnqSvyr` naq `fgevatf.Fcyvg`.** Vg cnffrf gur grfgf naq snvyf ba gur svyr gung znggref.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Fvyraprf ner n zbavgbevat ceboyrz svefg.** Va Cebzrgurhf, n gnetrg gung fgbcf ercbegvat qbrf
  abg sver na reebe nyreg; vg whfg unf ab fnzcyrf. `hc == 0` pngpurf n gnetrg gung gur freire
  pnaabg fpencr, naq `nofrag()` be `nofrag_bire_gvzr(zrgevp[10z])` pngpu n frevrf gung qvfnccrnef.
  07-ebyypnyy ohvyg gur syrrg irefvba bs guvf dhrfgvba. Tensnan Ybxv unf `nofrag_bire_gvzr` sbe ybt
  fgernzf gbb, fb "ab yvar sebz `ud-jvaqbj-01` sbe 10 zvahgrf" pna or na nyreg, abg n zbeavat
  fhecevfr.
- **Zbavgbe gur zbavgbevat.** Gur xhor-cebzrgurhf ehyrf fuvc n `Jngpuqbt` nyreg gung nyjnlf sverf.
  Na rkgreany freivpr rkcrpgf vg rirel srj zvahgrf naq cntrf jura vg fgbcf: n qrnq zna'f fjvgpu,
  gur fnzr vqrn nf n tnc va n ybt.
- **Obbgf yrnir znexf.** `wbheanypgy --yvfg-obbgf` yvfgf rirel obbg jvgu vgf svefg naq ynfg ragel,
  naq `wbheanypgy -o -1 -r` fubjf gur raq bs gur cerivbhf obbg: jurer gur fvyrapr fgnegf. `ynfg -k`
  yvfgf erobbgf naq fuhgqbjaf. N obbg jvgubhg n pyrna fuhgqbja orsber vg vf gur fnzr fgbel nf gur
  cbjre phg va guvf rkrepvfr.
- **Pybpxf whzc.** AGC pbeerpgvbaf, n qrivpr jvgubhg n erny-gvzr pybpx gung fgnegf va 1970, n IZ
  erfgberq sebz n fancfubg. Ybt cvcryvarf gung fbeg ol gvzrfgnzc (Ybxv, Rynfgvpfrnepu) pna uvqr
  fhpu yvarf be erwrpg gurz nf "gbb sne oruvaq"; ernqvat va vachg beqre, nf urer, fubjf gurz.
- **Fgernzvat gbbyf.** `jp -y`, `njx '{cevag $2}' | fbeg | havd -p` naq `yani` nyy fgernz. `yani`
  nyfb qenjf n uvfgbtenz bs yvarf bire gvzr, jurer n fvyrapr vf n ubyr va gur puneg.

## Jung pbzrf arkg

15-purpxqvfx gheaf n shapgvba yvxr guvf vagb n pbzznaq gung ernqf fgqva naq jevgrf fgqbhg, jvgu n
`znva` lbh pna grfg. 29-terc fgernzf ntnva, jvgu pbagrkg yvarf, n pbasvthenoyr yvar yvzvg naq
pbafgnag zrzbel. 38-ybtzretr ernqf znal fbheprf ng bapr, rnpu guebhtu n `ohsvb.Fpnaare`.

